    "Electronics has the weakest sampled in-sample separation: 20.2% of negatives outrank positives and its tenth-percentile margin is -0.7499. Wrong-rank rates are substantially lower in Industrial_and_Scientific (3.37%), Movies_and_TV (0.17%), and CDs_and_Vinyl (0.07%).",
    "Embedding scores of 0.56–0.6051 indicate modest mean directional alignment, not established collapse or recommendation diversity. History perturbations have zero completed users across all categories; position controls are unsupported and interventions were not run."
