  "key_implications": [
    "The sampled training pairs show uneven separation across datasets; these limited in-sample measurements do not establish validation HR@10 or generalization.",
    "History sensitivity and intervention effects remain unknown; no measured sensitivity intervals or training-seed comparisons support conclusions about them."
  ],
